WEBVTT

24:34.583 --> 24:36.293
Ah, the Starks...

24:36.418 --> 24:39.254
Quick tempers, slow minds.

24:44.426 --> 24:46.970
You broke my nose, bastard!

24:55.187 --> 24:56.354
It's an improvement.

24:59.608 --> 25:02.444
If we threw you over the Wall,
I wonder how long it would take you to hit.
